      steps: [
        "Step 1: Look to the left of the arrow.",
        "Step 2: H₂ and O₂ are written there.",
        "Step 3: Both are therefore reactants."
      ],
      ans: "Hydrogen (H₂) and oxygen (O₂).",
      why: "Both substances participate in forming water."
