      steps: [
        "Step 1: The straight-chain structure is pentane.",
        "Step 2: A four-carbon chain with one methyl branch gives 2-methylbutane.",
        "Step 3: A three-carbon parent chain with two methyl groups on carbon 2 gives 2,2-dimethylpropane."
      ],
