      steps: [
        "Step 1: Structural isomers have the same molecular formula but different atom connectivity.",
        "Step 2: Geometric isomers have the same connectivity.",
        "Step 3: Geometric isomers differ in the spatial arrangement of groups, commonly around a restricted C=C bond.",
        "Step 4: State the distinction clearly."
      ],
